                        "form": "malséante"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a0e27b4a-7330-41fc-8a8f-bdb9841a6e15",
                        "entry_id": "70a7fe43-ccbd-3c30-9bbf-f6043e09befb",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "malséantes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1321a63f-71d4-3cfb-8a6a-cf5f22f97b2b",
                        "entry_id": "70a7fe43-ccbd-3c30-9bbf-f6043e09befb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est contraire à la bienséance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "85220636-4f8f-41da-982b-266f4ca35dde",
                                "sense_id": "1321a63f-71d4-3cfb-8a6a-cf5f22f97b2b",
                                "text": "Disons d’ailleurs tout de suite que ces unions désignées dans le monde sous le nom de « mariages d’inclination » pour écarter le mot « amour » considéré comme malséant, sont souvent plus mal assorties que les autres."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7a69cbf-8455-48d5-802d-7e33f819af1b",
                                "sense_id": "1321a63f-71d4-3cfb-8a6a-cf5f22f97b2b",
                                "text": "Rien n’est plus déchirant, malséant presque, qu’une douleur, que des sanglots d’homme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d53fe011-f94b-4c57-98fc-f05fd85150f3",
                                "sense_id": "1321a63f-71d4-3cfb-8a6a-cf5f22f97b2b",
                                "text": "Je lui rends des services qu’elle ne rétribue pas. Il serait malséant qu’elle évaluât en livres sterling le taux de mes caresses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d212dbb4-7bbf-4448-8d3d-2f9c3d6666a4",
                                "sense_id": "1321a63f-71d4-3cfb-8a6a-cf5f22f97b2b",
                                "text": "L’on me fit aussitôt comprendre que ce texte n’était ni dans la ligne, ni dans la note et que ce que je m’apprêtais à dire paraîtrait fort malséant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8172314c-898b-40e4-8ff8-a2bb6b052a8c",
                                "sense_id": "1321a63f-71d4-3cfb-8a6a-cf5f22f97b2b",
                                "text": "C’était un rire frais, complice, abandonné, mais qu’il eût été malséant de prolonger."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "86505184-052b-4d41-a445-0074e052abc8",
                        "source_entry_id": "70a7fe43-ccbd-3c30-9bbf-f6043e09befb",
                        "source_sense_id": "1321a63f-71d4-3cfb-8a6a-cf5f22f97b2b",
                        "target_lang_word": "unseemly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unseemly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46cb1d4e-9131-373c-afb0-fabf327d5467",
                                        "entry_id": "ea5eedaf-709e-32f7-b7ac-db86b728e1cb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inconsistent with established standards of good form or taste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa420af6-cffc-49e9-a9d7-1b69cbf3dd50",
                                                "sense_id": "46cb1d4e-9131-373c-afb0-fabf327d5467",
                                                "text": "He was drunk and made some very unseemly comments."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dba08969-35a0-4979-af0c-bcae40043b79",
                                                "sense_id": "46cb1d4e-9131-373c-afb0-fabf327d5467",
                                                "text": "An unseemly outbreak of temper."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfb33570-ec44-41f7-8994-13b60cb42e50",
                                                "sense_id": "46cb1d4e-9131-373c-afb0-fabf327d5467",
                                                "text": "Many men, women and children, clothed in bright raiment for the Sabbath, saw with a faint flicker of interest and surprise a very white man on a trishaw, and the driver pedalling with unseemly haste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d1adda3-f757-4be8-9e01-4152a47839d1",
                                                "sense_id": "46cb1d4e-9131-373c-afb0-fabf327d5467",
                                                "text": "An all female race, the asari reproduce through a form of parthenogenesis. Each asari can attune her nervous system to that of another individual of any gender, and of any species, to reproduce. This capability has led to unseemly and inaccurate rumors about asari promiscuity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b77b091-aba1-46b0-9f1e-47184fadd60c",
                                                "sense_id": "46cb1d4e-9131-373c-afb0-fabf327d5467",
                                                "text": "[I]n the 575 days since [Oscar] Pistorius shot dead his girlfriend Reeva Steenkamp, there has been an unseemly scramble to construct revisionist histories, to identify evidence beneath that placid exterior of a pugnacious, hair-trigger personality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unseemly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "056cacf0-216d-3e7e-979f-770ade97c12a",
                                        "entry_id": "9ec7b223-32ba-3931-b714-9f0f5ed86a92",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an unseemly manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b6f2aa57-6783-418f-a3a5-784d595dc313",
                        "source_entry_id": "70a7fe43-ccbd-3c30-9bbf-f6043e09befb",
                        "source_sense_id": "1321a63f-71d4-3cfb-8a6a-cf5f22f97b2b",
                        "target_lang_word": "unbecoming",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unbecoming",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4f02c24-6564-338a-a89d-7b8c7a85d728",
                                        "entry_id": "0f0c4069-ac2e-385d-bd82-8c007c3a21f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not flattering, attractive or appropriate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13021f91-5f84-4e04-9ad5-24fe97851764",
                                                "sense_id": "b4f02c24-6564-338a-a89d-7b8c7a85d728",
                                                "text": "― Lily: “Don’t stare so much. It’s unbecoming. It makes you look like a country bumpkin.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad037a53-0e5e-41a8-85f7-7d875521da98",
                                                "sense_id": "b4f02c24-6564-338a-a89d-7b8c7a85d728",
                                                "text": "She wore a rather unbecoming hairstyle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "758b3436-951f-422c-8f75-c1ae9716fd4e",
                                                "sense_id": "b4f02c24-6564-338a-a89d-7b8c7a85d728",
                                                "text": "A very small expensive black toque was hideously unbecoming to the yellow, toad-like face beneath it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b72c8c9-ea9b-4ba6-b6f4-d267bed5029a",
                                                "sense_id": "b4f02c24-6564-338a-a89d-7b8c7a85d728",
                                                "text": "With its lavish brass and copperwork, this [bright chocolate] seemed a trifle too gay and unbecoming for a G.W.R. locomotive, and apparently the Company soon shared this view for there was a reversion to the standard Brunswick green."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3676a2d7-c516-4675-bad1-2ad3ae9b48f8",
                                                "sense_id": "b4f02c24-6564-338a-a89d-7b8c7a85d728",
                                                "text": "Being a gym bunny is simply unbecoming. Not as unbecoming, perhaps, as the bicycle bunnies, with their helmet hair, their strangely padded Lycras that suggest a degree of sexual depravity and those ridiculous clacky shoes. But we’re not very pleasing to behold."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "408fb1c6-7541-3eed-9904-3a7f0c750a5c",
                                        "entry_id": "0f0c4069-ac2e-385d-bd82-8c007c3a21f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not in keeping with the expected standards of one's position."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f60203a-177d-4825-a265-8a3b5de450a7",
                                                "sense_id": "408fb1c6-7541-3eed-9904-3a7f0c750a5c",
                                                "text": "He was accused of conduct unbecoming an officer and a gentleman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14267b05-6cff-4efe-b51e-04452311bed2",
                                                "sense_id": "408fb1c6-7541-3eed-9904-3a7f0c750a5c",
                                                "text": "No proceedings in respect of unbecoming conduct shall be taken in respect of the lawful political opinions or activities of any bishop, priest or deacon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d84827d-355b-435d-8248-9a95cdeb79d5",
                                                "sense_id": "408fb1c6-7541-3eed-9904-3a7f0c750a5c",
                                                "text": "“You must be able to smell it too, Chloe. That smell of . . . Well, I’m not going to say what it reminds me of, that would be impolite and unbecoming of a woman of my class and distinction, but it’s a bad smell.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a3f4c91-020a-4eee-a16c-64365f32086f",
                                                "sense_id": "408fb1c6-7541-3eed-9904-3a7f0c750a5c",
                                                "text": "[Prince Andrew:] Do I regret the fact that he [Jeff Epstein] has quite obviously conducted himself in a manner unbecoming? Yes.\n [Emily Maitlis]: Unbecoming? He was a sex offender.\n [Prince Andrew:] Yeah, I'm sorry, I'm being polite."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unbecoming",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0802769-b7b6-3a68-a7c8-ee6a84874d86",
                                        "entry_id": "89316813-19cf-3482-aea7-320fb4105cd1",
